Again, I'm not super-experienced with this, but I've ascended a
Tourist two-weaponing Mjollnir with a silver saber (both at +5 or
+6), and most monsters went down pretty quickly. Valks should
do even better. There aren't actually that many shock-resistant
monsters -- besides the thematic ones, it's mostly arch-liches
(which you should genocide on your first try at ascending),
Aleaxes, Angels, and Archons (which according to the spoilers
will be peaceful to a lawful even if you see one). Which means
you won't have much trouble until the Astral plane, when there
will be a lot of Angels to deal with.

The wand/ring explosion is a pain, though. Don't use it on Orcus.


